1. Introduction

The Cardano Savings Pool DApp is a decentralized savings application built on the Cardano blockchain using:

Plutus V2 smart contract

Haskell backend API (Servant)

Static frontend with CIP‑30 wallet integration

Deployment via Vercel


The goal is to allow users to participate in a trustless savings pool where deposits are made on‑chain and withdrawals are controlled by a deadline and wallet owner.


---

2. Project Overview

This project consists of three main parts:

cardano-savings-pool/
├── contract/        Smart contract validator
├── backend/         Servant API for off‑chain logic
├── frontend/        HTML + JS + Haskell UI components
├── README.md        Project overview
└── vercel.json      Deployment config

Each component interacts to provide a full dApp experience:

Smart contract enforces on‑chain rules

Frontend allows user interaction

Backend provides REST API for status/info



